:: R4-GhostReaperCommunity [release4]
<<scene "img/ui/discord-hype.png" "ETHX-CHAN ERA INCOMING">>

The community Discord is losing its mind. GhostReaper42, one of my oldest regulars, starts a thread titled "ETHX-CHAN ERA INCOMING" with a fan edited photo of my face photoshopped onto an anime girl body. It's terrible. It's also got forty reactions within an hour.

